  "title": "How a Credit Card Scanning SDK Can Streamline Your Payment Process and Boost Conversions",
  "summary": "E-commerce sales are estimated to exceed $6.3 trillion U.S. dollars worldwide, and nearly a third of all transactions use a credit or debit card. As a result, businesses have to provide smooth and secure payment experiences to retain customers and maximize conversions. One way to achieve this is by integrating a credit card scanning SDK or Software Development Kit. This streamlined process reduces friction in the checkout experience, minimizes fraud, leads to happier customers and increases sales.",
